      <memberdef kind="function" id="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a2f4c0fd4d6bf36b880ae052506c8d7d6" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" noexcept="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void terminal::CSI::finalize</definition>
        <argsstring>() noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>finalize</name>
        <qualifiedname>terminal::CSI::finalize</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Finalizes parameter accumulation after all parameter characters are consumed. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Called by the parser after the <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i" kindref="compound">CSI</ref> parameter string is complete (typically when the final byte is encountered). If a value was being accumulated, it is stored as the final parameter.</para>
<para>This method is idempotent — calling it multiple times has no additional effect after the first call (until <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a58906bacf120dd611ab969af1a46c1bd" kindref="member">reset()</ref></computeroutput> is called).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Empty Sequences</title><para>If no parameters were specified (e.g., <computeroutput>ESC[m</computeroutput>), this method does nothing and <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1ab3dded4e066fc2b01f8aa2a71a82d0eb" kindref="member">count</ref></computeroutput> remains zero. Dispatch handlers typically treat this as a default case (e.g., SGR reset).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Single Parameter</title><para>For <computeroutput>ESC[5m</computeroutput>, after <computeroutput>addDigit(5)</computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a2f4c0fd4d6bf36b880ae052506c8d7d6" kindref="member">finalize()</ref></computeroutput> stores the value: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Before:<sp/>hasAccumulator<sp/>=<sp/>true,<sp/>accumulator<sp/>=<sp/>5,<sp/>count<sp/>=<sp/>0</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a2f4c0fd4d6bf36b880ae052506c8d7d6" kindref="member">finalize</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>After:<sp/>hasAccumulator<sp/>=<sp/>false,<sp/>values[0]<sp/>=<sp/>5,<sp/>count<sp/>=<sp/>1</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>READER THREAD only. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Must be called before <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a47b7740c7f5e36382fbd6812be573b2f" kindref="member">param()</ref></computeroutput> is used during dispatch. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
