      <memberdef kind="function" id="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a47b7740c7f5e36382fbd6812be573b2f" prot="public" static="no" const="yes" explicit="no" inline="yes" noexcept="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>uint16_t</type>
        <definition>uint16_t terminal::CSI::param</definition>
        <argsstring>(uint8_t index, uint16_t defaultValue) const noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>param</name>
        <qualifiedname>terminal::CSI::param</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>uint8_t</type>
          <declname>index</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>uint16_t</type>
          <declname>defaultValue</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Retrieves a parameter value by index with a default fallback. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i" kindref="compound">CSI</ref> dispatch handlers to safely access parameter values. If the requested index is out of range (&gt;= count), the default value is returned.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Default Value Semantics</title><para>The default value depends on the specific <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i" kindref="compound">CSI</ref> command:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="struct_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> positioning (CUP, HVP): default is 1 (first row/column)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SGR (text attributes): default is 0 (reset/normal)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Erase (ED, EL): default is 0 (erase below/to right)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
The caller (dispatch handler) is responsible for choosing the appropriate default value based on the command being processed.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>index</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Zero-based parameter index (0 = first parameter). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>defaultValue</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classValue" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Value</ref> to return if the parameter was not specified.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The parameter value at <computeroutput>index</computeroutput>, or <computeroutput>defaultValue</computeroutput> if index &gt;= count.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>READER THREAD only. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a2f4c0fd4d6bf36b880ae052506c8d7d6" kindref="member">finalize()</ref></computeroutput> must be called before using this method.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Example</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>&quot;ESC[5m&quot;,<sp/>count<sp/>=<sp/>1,<sp/>values[0]<sp/>=<sp/>5</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a47b7740c7f5e36382fbd6812be573b2f" kindref="member">param</ref>(0,<sp/>0);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>returns<sp/>5</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a47b7740c7f5e36382fbd6812be573b2f" kindref="member">param</ref>(1,<sp/>0);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>returns<sp/>0<sp/>(default,<sp/>index<sp/>out<sp/>of<sp/>range)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>&quot;ESC[m&quot;,<sp/>count<sp/>=<sp/>0</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_c_s_i_1a47b7740c7f5e36382fbd6812be573b2f" kindref="member">param</ref>(0,<sp/>0);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>returns<sp/>0<sp/>(default)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
